<title>USA: CB Financial Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>CB Financial Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Mich. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.67		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			  1,895		    1,011</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 results include restructuring charge. Excluding the charge, earnings were $1.7 million or $0.36/shr for the 1995 Q3.</p>
<p>		   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.63		    $1.37</p>
<p> Net			  4,579		    3,843</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine-month results include restructuring charge. Excluding charge, earnings were $5.3 million or $1.89/shr.</p>
<p>1995 nine-month results include $0.23/shr restructuring charge.</p>
<p>Assets $784.3 million vs $700.4 million</p>
<p>Deposits $680.2 million vs $608.9 million</p>
<p>Loans $574.2 million vs $412.0 million</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
